1
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:02,820
《打工姐妹花》前情提要
Previously on "2 Broke Girls"...

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,360
我选择将这场灾难当做一个启示
I am choosing to take this disaster as a sign,

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,220
在他们重建这里的时候
and while they're rebuilding this place

4
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:10,100
我要去给兰迪惊喜 重建我们感情
I'm gonna go surprise Randy and try to rebuild us!

5
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,280
行吧 开我的车去
Fine, use my car,

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,860
但必须是我来驾驶 我要跟你去
but I'm going to be driving it. I'm coming with you.

7
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,860
我好不容易才把短腿油门辅助器调到位
I finally got the gas pedal extension where I like it.

8
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,280
我在这等保险公司来拖车就行
I'll just call AAA.

9
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:20,740
那太好啦 再见 拜拜
Cool. Later, hater.

10
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,160
等等 你们真的一走了之啊
Wait, you're really leaving?

11
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,700
什么人会把别人就这么丢在
Who leaves someone on the side of the road

12
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:26,860
荒郊野岭的路边啊
in the middle of nowhere?

13
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,780
但是我的朋友邋遢乔有一台单引擎飞机
My friend, Sloppy Joe, has a one-engine plane.

14
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,820
他或许有办法载你们飞去洛杉矶
He might be able to fly y'all all the way to LA.

15
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,180
我们在奥斯丁 德克萨斯州拍摄的第一天
Well, that's a wrap on the first day of filming

16
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,080
就到此结束啦
here in Austin, Texas.

17
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,300
等等 所以兰迪不在洛杉矶吗
So Randy's not in Los Angeles?

18
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,160
他是在德州
He's in Texas?

19
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,980
麦克斯 你真是个蹩脚的跟踪狂
Wow, you're a bad stalker, Max.

20
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,320
我邋遢平生有两件事不做
There's two things the Slop won't do.

21
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,740
告知相关单位我的飞行模式
Alert the proper authorities of my flight pattern

22
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,560
以及踏进德克萨斯州
or step foot in Texas.

23
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,320
我在这里放你们下
I'll drop you here.

24
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:57,240
我答应跟你横越全国
When I agreed to follow you cross-country

25
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,640
去千里寻男友时
to chase your ex-boyfriend,

26
00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:02,260
我没想到我会被扔下飞机
I didn't realize I'd be thrown out of a plane,

27
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:04,140
像拾荒般到处捡我的东西
scavenging for my belongings

28
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:06,940
还得跟一条蛇抢我最爱的裤子
and fighting a snake for my favorite pants.

29
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,480
您留着吧 蛇先生
You can have them, sir!

30
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:12,080
找到我的牙刷啦
Ah! Found my toothbrush.

31
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:15,560
麦克斯 太恶心了吧
Max, that's disgusting.

32
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:18,340
好像是有点恶心 这不是我的
Oh, you're right. This isn't mine.

33
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:21,340
找到个包包
Ah, found a purse...

34
00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:23,180
上面有根针筒
Under this syringe.

35
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:24,780
针筒里有东西吗
Anything in there?

36
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:29,320
基本都空了 真是太倒霉了
Nah, pretty tapped out, which is too bad

37
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:31,040
你可以睡一场两天长的海洛因觉
'cause you could use a two-day heroin nap.

38
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,800
我是说我包里
I meant my bag.

39
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,360
你看还有什么幸免于难
Look what else survived!

40
00:01:35,425 --> 00:01:37,460
我的薯片
My Popchips!

41
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:41,080
它在劫难逃的是我的肚子
Only to meet an unfortunate end.

42
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:43,920
惨了 麦克斯 我的钱包
Oh, no, Max, my wallet.

43
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,480
是啊 是很惨
Mm, yeah, I know.

44
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,420
你比驾照那张照片 老了不是一点半点
You've aged a lot since that license picture.

45
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,460
是钱包丢了
No, it's gone.

46
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,620
我们所有的现金跟信用卡都在里面呢
All of our cash and our credit cards were in there.

47
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:54,999
我们该怎么办 我要抓狂了
What are we gonna do? I'm freaking out.

48
00:01:54,999 --> 00:01:57,600
别别别 先冷静
Nah, nah, nah, calm down.

49
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,240
卡洛琳会想办法救我们的
Caroline will get us out of this.

50
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,140
等等 你就是卡洛琳
Oh, wait. You're Caroline.

51
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,080
我要打给餐厅求救了
I'm calling the diner for help.

52
00:02:04,410 --> 00:02:05,964
阿憨... 我... 有...
Han... We... have..

53
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:09,520
卡洛琳 我们信号[关系]不好
Caroline, we don't have a good connection,

54
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,460
不单是因为我们俩天蝎座相冲
and not just because we're dueling Scorpios.

55
00:02:13,095 --> 00:02:14,220
躲猫猫
Peek-a-boo!

56
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,520
我看到你啦
I see you!

57
00:02:16,626 --> 00:02:18,340
奥列格
Oleg.

58
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:20,220
好啦 现在跟芭芭拉这么玩吧
All right, now do it with Barbara.

59
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,780
阿憨 我们所有的私人物品
Han, we had all of our belongings

60
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:29,400
全被从私人飞机上扔下去了
thrown out of a private plane.

61
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,480
卡洛琳 你的信号断断续续
Caroline, you're cutting out.

62
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:35,500
我只听见"私人飞机" 你个臭显摆
All I heard was "private plane" brag much?

63
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:38,000
不是 我们需要去到德州
No, we need to get to Texas,

64
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:41,940
你能往我支付宝里打五百块吗
so can you please put $500 in my PayPal account?

65
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:44,420
什么 你有五百块吗
What? You have $500?

66
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:48,500
我买这件酷炫背心时 有打给你炫耀吗
Did I call you to gloat when I bought this snazzy new vest?

67
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:50,120
我要开免提
I'm putting you on speaker.

68
00:02:51,140 --> 00:02:52,140
私人飞机...
Private plane...

69
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:54,133
有... 信用卡
Have...credit card...

70
00:02:55,420 --> 00:02:56,840
断线了
We lost her.

71
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:59,800
或者是她的管家把她电话抢走了
Or maybe her butler snatched her phone from her.

72
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:02,900
他挂电话了
He hung up.

73
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:06,840
麦克斯 我们能回去我们称为家的那地狱吗
Max, can we just go back to that terrible place we call home?

74
00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:08,940
那只美洲狮在穿我的新衣服了
That mountain lion is wearing my new blouse.

75
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:10,560
她追来啦
And here she comes!

76
00:03:11,940 --> 00:03:14,620
你想退钱的话 记得留着吊牌
Keep the tags on if you wanna return it.

77
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:29,860
我要打给信用卡公司
I'm calling the credit card company

78
00:03:29,860 --> 00:03:31,060
让他们给我们寄新卡
to send us new cards.

79
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:32,680
他们已经习惯听我哭了
They're used to hearing me cry.

80
00:03:33,260 --> 00:03:34,540
我们看《疯狂动物城》时
So is the unfortunate family

81
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:36,080
坐后面的一家人也听习惯了
that sat behind us at "Zootopia."

82
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:39,380
连动物间都能当好朋友 我们也行
If animals can all get along, so can we.

83
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:41,720
等我们拿到新卡
Look, once we get our cards,

84
00:03:41,740 --> 00:03:43,560
我们就能继续上路去德州找兰迪
we'll be on our way to Randy in Texas--

85
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,239
这整件事对我有啥好处来着呢
and what was in this for me again?

86
00:03:45,239 --> 00:03:47,939
5.5次濒死经验吗
5 1/2 near-death experiences?

87
00:03:50,180 --> 00:03:52,140
信用卡公司 是我 卡洛琳
Hi, Visa. It's me, Caroline.

88
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,800
我的卡被偷了
My cards were stolen.

89
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,940
我在一些面包车的后车厢
I've seen backs of vans

90
00:03:59,940 --> 00:04:01,420
看过的糖果种类都比你店里好
with better candy selections.

91
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:04,220
你们真是丢了"有油又有吃"这店名
This is a disgrace to the name Gas and Gobble.

92
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,720
你每天哪来的动力起床啊
How do you even wake up in the morning?

93
00:04:07,380 --> 00:04:08,840
被我的鳄鱼舔脸舔醒的
My alligator licks my face.

94
00:04:09,860 --> 00:04:11,280
天啊 麦克斯
Oh, my God, Max.

95
00:04:11,380 --> 00:04:13,980
偷我们卡的人 把我们卡刷爆了
Whoever stole our credit cards maxed them out.

96
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:16,780
把我们所剩的1500花完了
They spent the $1,500 we had left.

97
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:17,740
不是吧
No way.

98
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:21,340
刚刚才有人花了1500块买手机卡跟香烟
Someone just spent $1,500 on phone cards and cigarettes.

99
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:23,520
他的名字叫卡洛琳·钱宁
His name was Caroline Channing.

100
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:24,520
什么
What?

101
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,700
那是我的名字
That's my name!

102
00:04:26,540 --> 00:04:28,080
你有个男人的名字啊
Ah, you got a dude's name.

103
00:04:28,940 --> 00:04:30,677
我们被抢了 警察叔叔
Ugh, we were robbed. Police!

104
00:04:30,677 --> 00:04:32,290
-哪里 -哪里
- Where! - Where!

105
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:35,200
麦克斯 我又累又饿
Max, I am tired and I'm hungry

106
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,420
而且找不到个镜子
and I can't find a mirror,

107
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:38,660
但我感觉到头发部位有"乱流"
but I am sensing a disturbance in my hair.

108
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:40,960
我们得回家了
We have to go home!

109
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,800
但我们必须去德州啊
But we have to go to Texas.

110
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,320
兰迪需要我
Randy needs me.

111
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:46,380
他在快拍上说了
He's saying it on his Snapchat story.

112
00:04:47,740 --> 00:04:49,180
还在电影片场
Still on the movie set.

113
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:51,080
挺寂寞 如果有人愿意
Pretty lonely, so if anyone would respond

114
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:52,460
接受我手机拼字游戏的邀请
to my Words With Friends request,

115
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,420
我答应放水让你赢
I promise to let you win,

116
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:54,960
如果你来德州了
and if you're ever in Texas...

117
00:04:55,826 --> 00:04:57,574
何苦啊
why?

118
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:02,360
你看 他在求我去找他
See? He's begging me to come there.

119
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:05,240
但我们没钱去那里啊
But we have no money to get to Texas.

120
00:05:05,580 --> 00:05:06,140
错了
Wrong.

121
00:05:06,216 --> 00:05:11,460
我这半边里藏了11块
I've got $11 in this one

122
00:05:11,460 --> 00:05:15,260
这边藏了32块
and $32 in this one.

123
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:18,040
左边跟平常一样留了一手
Lefty's been holding back as per usual.

124
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:21,020
所以你的这43块奶钱
So your 43 boob dollars

125
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:22,440
能让我们去到德州吗
are gonna get us to Texas?

126
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,840
还有我的菊花硬币呢
Don't rule out my roll of butt quarters.

127
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:26,200
汗水淋淋但准备就绪
Sweaty but ready.

128
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,400
你们能帮忙关店吗
All right, can y'all folks lock up?

129
00:05:28,770 --> 00:05:30,320
我得赶在内河船
I got to make a riverboat

130
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:31,500
出发去新奥尔良之前上船
before it takes off to New Orleans.

131
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:33,680
我的亲戚蒂姆给我下降头了
My cousin Tim put a voodoo curse on me.

132
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,980
我得去跟他谈谈 让他帮我弄掉
I got to talk to him about removing it.

133
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:37,000
卡洛琳
Caroline,

134
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:39,700
新奥尔良离德州挺近
New Orleans is close to Texas.

135
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,560
我的麦当劳桌垫上的汉堡神偷是这么说的
The Hamburglar says so on my McDonald's placemat,

136
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,820
他这人从不说谎
and he would never lie

137
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:46,140
除非是为了偷好吃的汉堡时才会
unless it's about stealing delicious hamburgers.

138
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,120
我有点迷糊了 你是想吃汉堡
I'm confused. Do you want hamburgers

139
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,680
还是想去搭内河船
or do you wanna take that riverboat?

140
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:53,180
很明显 最好的情况就是两者皆是
Obviously, the dream scenario is both.

141
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:58,120
多谢
Ah, thank you very much.

142
00:05:58,540 --> 00:06:00,060
麦克斯 上船要票的
Max, people have tickets.

143
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:01,880
你得付钱才能上这...
You have to pay to get on this--

144
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:05,120
我挺确定会是我第六次濒死经验
what I'm positive will be my sixth near-death experience.

145
00:06:05,820 --> 00:06:07,340
转身弯腰 松开菊花
So bend over and unclench.

146
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,540
你的菊花硬币也得用上
We need those butt quarters.

147
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:11,760
你是带我去参加教堂嘉年华时的我妈吗
Who are you? My mother at a church carnival?

148
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:15,320
请准备好您的船票
Have your tickets ready, please.

149
00:06:15,900 --> 00:06:17,700
我们表现得不突兀就行了
All we have to do is act like we belong.

150
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:21,300
那我能装出我可爱的南方口音吗
Do I at least get to have an adorable Southern accent?

151
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,340
不许装口音
No accent.

152
00:06:22,740 --> 00:06:24,180
我表四
Well, I do declare

153
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:26,340
这真素太令人苏望啦
that is mighty disappointing.

154
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:29,980
学着点 是时候对陌生人伸魔爪啦
Just follow my lead. It's time to touch strangers.

155
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,940
你的双枪[二头肌]有持枪证吗
Hey, you got a permit for those guns?

156
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,720
我说
Well, I say,

157
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,601
你有许可证...
you got a permit for

158
00:06:40,601 --> 00:06:43,360
来携带那发光溜溜球吗
that light-up yo-yo?

159
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,760
我有女朋友了
I have a girlfriend.

160
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:47,820
少废话 臭小鬼
Keep walking, buster.

161
00:06:55,020 --> 00:06:57,860
麦克斯 这船到新奥尔良要两天呢
Max, the riverboat doesn't get to New Orleans for two days

162
00:06:57,860 --> 00:06:59,440
我们没地方睡啊
and we have nowhere to sleep.

163
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:00,639
但是这船上有
Ooh, but there is

164
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:03,420
"自己做斑鸠琴"课 在五点
a "Whittle Your Own Banj" workshop at 5:00.

165
00:07:03,420 --> 00:07:05,500
我对这"班就"一点兴趣都没有
I have whittle-to-no interest in that.

166
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:08,480
上面写这里有最好赢的老虎机[最荡的妞]
Ooh, it says they have the loosest slots around.

167
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:10,920
看来我老家的浪货达比姐妹也在船上
I guess the Darby sisters from my hometown are here.

168
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:13,160
我看到那边的沼泽展览区
I did see a bunch of lounge chairs

169
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,660
有不少躺椅
over by the swamp exhibit.

170
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:16,100
我猜我们今晚可以试着在那里睡
I guess we could sleep there tonight,

171
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:17,260
至于明天晚上呢
and then the next night,

172
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:19,000
好运的话 到时候我们已经死了呢
well, hopefully we'll be dead.

173
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,540
来吧 红
Come on, red!

174
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:22,740
麦克斯 不可以 这是我们所有的钱
Max, no! That's all of our money!

175
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:23,680
停止下注
No more bets.

176
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:25,780
这太蠢了
